    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "h6",
      "text": "Brainstorming Sessions"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Identified multiple media sharing applications on Apple Vision Pro and Meta Quest platforms. Some were native apps while most were third-party. Each competitor tackled and faced a unique problem."
    },
    {
      "kind": "component",
      "name": "Dot Slider",
      "controls": {
        "dot1": "true",
        "dot2": "true",
        "dot3": "true",
        "dot4": "true",
        "dot5": "false"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "h6",
      "text": "Competitor Analysis"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Conducted 15+ interviews with users of traditional media outlets, creators looking to publish spatial content, headset owners and even company founders to evaluate business use cases."
    },
    {
      "kind": "component",
      "name": "Dot Slider",
      "controls": {
        "dot1": "true",
        "dot2": "true",
        "dot3": "true",
        "dot4": "true",
        "dot5": "false"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "h6",
      "text": "User Interviews"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "We developed user personas representing spatial content viewers and creators, ensuring our platform addressed their real-world needs. These profiles provided insights into motivations, constraints, and expectations, guiding feature prioritization and user-centric design."
    },
    {
      "kind": "component",
      "name": "Dot Slider",
      "controls": {
        "dot1": "true",
        "dot2": "true",
        "dot3": "true",
        "dot4": "true",
        "dot5": "false"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "h6",
      "text": "Persona Building"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "We synthesized insights from user interviews, competitor analysis, and team brainstorming sessions through affinity mapping. This process enabled structured categorization of user pain points, core needs, and prioritized features. As a result, all design decisions were grounded in validated, user-centered insights."
    },
    {
      "kind": "component",
      "name": "Dot Slider",
      "controls": {
        "dot1": "true",
        "dot2": "true",
        "dot3": "true",
        "dot4": "true",
        "dot5": "false"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "h6",
      "text": "Affinity Mapping"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Organized a full-stack team to go over all aspects of developing such an app. Addressed development issues, backend, and AI implementation to manage content uploads, delivery, recommendations, and more. Prototyped in Figma and further in development"
    },
    {
      "kind": "component",
      "name": "Dot Slider",
      "controls": {
        "dot1": "true",
        "dot2": "true",
        "dot3": "true",
        "dot4": "true",
        "dot5": "false"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "component",
      "name": "Highlighter Tag",
      "controls": {
        "title": "Spatial Content Everywhere"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "h6",
      "text": "New ways to view content"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Omnia pioneers the future of immersive media by enabling the upload and exploration of Spatial Photos, Panoramas, Videos, and Gaussian Splats formats traditionally locked within proprietary ecosystems. I designed a community-powered gallery experience, purpose-built for VR/AR headsets, that transforms spatial content into a collective, explorable dimension."
    },
    {
      "kind": "component",
      "name": "Vimeo",
      "controls": {
        "uRL": "https://vimeo.com/1096030532?share=copy",
        "radius": "32px",
        "controls": "false",
        "autoplay": "true",
        "loop": "true",
        "mute": "true",
        "background": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "component",
      "name": "Highlighter Tag",
      "controls": {
        "title": "Spatial Web"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "h6",
      "text": "Articles, WebPages, Media ... and more!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Designed new interfaces to view AI summaries and full web pages with spatial media."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Flipping through summary cards is efficient, spatial, and works well alongside other apps. User research proved that people read more content generated by AI Summaries, and now they can do so in Augmented Reality."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Spatial web-browsing is the next step in Augmented Reality interfaces. All images on a page appear in a top carousel for immediate access, followed by the text. Only the text in view is bright, the rest is dimmed to avoid visual distraction. Scrolling brings it in view. The Ai summaries can be accessed in a side panel if desired. Easy access to an AI assistant was key for the future of browisng as well, and lives in the Safari-inspired bottom tab bar."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "These design elements predate Apple's spatial web browsing update with VisionOS 26."
    },
    {
      "kind": "image",
      "src": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/SO2G3kOkjAQNCcpZsuvainC0y1E.png",
      "alt": "",
      "name": "Fill Your Image Here"
    },
    {
      "kind": "image",
      "src": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/0tDBpYJFUS1iEF1Rm9MlwHE1ch0.png",
      "alt": "",
