    },
    {
      "kind": "component",
      "name": "Highlighter Tag",
      "controls": {
        "title": "Adaptive Game UI"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "h6",
      "text": "Same web-based games… with spatial controls"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "WebXR games promise immersive play but fragmentation across VR/AR devices has limited their reach."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Omnia revolutionizes this by making spatial games instantly cross-compatible, no developer intervention required. I designed the Adaptable Game UI to elevate this breakthrough—interfaces now morph to match the hardware in real time."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Imagine gripping a virtual steering wheel rendered precisely to your device, without a single line of extra code. That’s the power of Omnia’s adaptive runtime."
    },
    {
      "kind": "image",
      "src": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/MyNzsMX3Sn6stxEu66zHnqydKtE.png",
      "alt": "",
      "name": "Fill Your Image Here"
    },
    {
      "kind": "image",
      "src": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/0xZZfg7nMnrrEeeTRtvvVVh5Bg.png",
      "alt": "",
      "name": "Fill Your Image Here"
    },
    {
      "kind": "component",
      "name": "Highlighter Tag",
      "controls": {
        "title": "3D Model Viewer"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "h6",
      "text": "Intuitive Zoom & Rotation Controls"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Designed brand new zoom sliders and rotation controls for 3D models. Allowing users to interact with and view the model with a single hand instead of having to rely on two-handed gestures that are native to the OS. This was a highly requested feature by factory workers due to the nature of their work."
    },
    {
      "kind": "image",
      "src": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/NzfSs1GSyNsHghMsSnsvP0zKF8.png",
      "alt": "",
      "name": "Fill Your Image Here"
    },
    {
      "kind": "component",
      "name": "Highlighter Tag",
      "controls": {
        "title": "E-Commerce"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "h6",
      "text": "Buy what you see"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "I modified the designs of the 3D model viewer to accommodate e-commerce requirements. Users can view product listings, see all related content like videos, models, and photos, along with the description, price, and more!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Using \"Apple Pay\", users will authenticate using the built-in Face ID without any added steps."
    },
